# shir_nodes/foreach_line.node — STREAMING line iteration over a file.
#
# The dynamic-source primitive: reduces `cmd file` / `grep P F | cmd`
# pipelines to a lazy per-line loop — O(1) memory, never slurps the file
# where bash itself streams. Body statements use the existing VALUE
# primitives (FieldExtract/Contains/RegSub/…) per line.
#
# Backends: Perl while(<$fh>), JS sh2.eachLine (readline), C getline,
# Go bufio.Scanner, Zig reader loop.

node ForEachLine
tag "ForEachLine"
field source: expr
field var: string
field body: stmts
